# WARNING to anyone running a link checker against this directory.
#
# These files are authored relative to mythos/content/ in the umbrella
# repository, which is not where they physically sit here. So a link like
# ../README.md resolves to nothing as a file in *this* repo, and resolves
# correctly on the published site, where src/lib/docs.js rewrites it to
# the umbrella's mythos/README.md.
#
# Do not "fix" these by hand-editing the copies. Hand-editing is exactly
# the drift the mirror check exists to prevent, and it is how CODEX fell
# six sections behind canon without anyone noticing. If a link is genuinely
# wrong, fix it in the umbrella and re-mirror.
#
# The umbrella commit this content set was mirrored from.
# Verified by .github/scripts/check-canon-mirror.py in CI.
#
# Bumping this is a deliberate act: re-copy mythos/content/ from the
# umbrella at the new commit, update the sha below, and the pull request
# diff shows exactly what changed and what became public.
#
# TerAustralis-Incognita @ main, 2026-07-29
